hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"691","(70) Luqata aur gumshuda janwaron ka bab: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas aur Amr ibn al-Harith aur Sufyan ibn Sa'id al-Thawri aur ghairon ne mujhe khabar di ke Rabi'ah ibn Abi Abdur Rahman ne un se hadees bayan ki, Yazid maula al-Munba'ith se, Zaid ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur main Aap ke saath tha, pas us ne luqata (padi hui cheez) ke baare me sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ke bartan (ifas) aur us ke bandhan (wika) ko pehchan le, phir us ka ek saal tak elaan kar, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye (to use de de) warna phir tu us ke baare me jo chahe kar, unhon ne kaha: To bhatki hui bakri? Aap ne farmaya: Woh tere liye hai, ya tere bhai ke liye, ya bhediye ke liye. Unhon ne kaha: To bhatka hua oont? Aap ne farmaya: Us ke saath us ke jute (khur) aur us ki mashk hai, woh pani par aata hai aur darakht se khata hai, yahan tak ke use us ka maalik pa le."
"692","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sufyan se (ha). Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abdur Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Rabi'ah ibn Abi Abdur Rahman se, Yazid maula al-Munba'ith se, Zaid ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se luqata ke baare me sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elaan kar, pas agar koi tere paas aaye jo tujhe us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ke baare me bataye (to use de de), warna us se faida utha. Aur us ne Aap se bhatke hue oont ke baare me sawal kiya? To Aap ka chehra (ghusse se) surkh ho gaya, aur farmaya: Tujhe us se kya? Us ke saath us ke jute aur us ki mashk hai, woh pani par aata hai aur darakht se khata hai, use chhod de yahan tak ke use us ka maalik pa le. Aur us ne Aap se bhatki hui bakri ke baare me sawal kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Woh tere liye hai, ya tere bhai ke liye, ya bhediye ke liye. Yeh al-Firyabi ki hadees hai."
"693","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Amr al-Ghazzi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Firyabi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Salamah ibn Kuhail se, Suwaid ibn Ghafalah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine ek koda paya to use utha liya, to Zaid ibn Suhan aur Salman ibn Rabi'ah ne mujh par us ko bura jana, to maine kaha: Agar maine us ke maalik ko pa liya to use us ke hawale kar dunga warna us se faida uthaunga, unhon ne kaha: Pas maine us ka zikr Ubayy ibn Ka'b se kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tum ne acha kiya, tum ne acha kiya; maine ek thaili pai to use Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas laya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ka elaan kar, pas maine us ka ek saal elaan kiya, pas mujhe koi na mila jo use pehchanta ho, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ki ginti aur us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ko jaan le, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de, warna us se faida utha."
"694","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: al-Dahhak ibn Uthman ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Nadr se, Busr ibn Sa'id se, Zaid ibn Khalid al-Juhani Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se luqata ke baare me sawal kiya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elaan kar, pas agar woh pehchani na jaye to us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ko pehchan le, phir use kha le, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de."
"695","Ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith aur Hisham ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, Amr ibn Shu'aib se, un ke walid se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Muzaina ka ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, us ne kaha: Aap kya farmate hain us ke baare me jo aam aamad-o-raft wali rah me aur aabaad basti me paya jaye? Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elaan kar, pas agar us ka talash karne wala aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de, warna phir tu us ke baare me jo chahe kar, aur agar us ka talib zamane me kabhi bhi aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de, aur jo ghair aamad-o-raft wali rah me ho, ya ghair aabaad basti me ho, to us me aur rikaz (dafina) me panchwan (khums) hai."
"696","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Amir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'bah se, Khalid al-Hazza se, Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn al-Shikhkhir se, Mutarrif se, Iyad ibn Himar Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo luqata uthaye to use chahiye ke ek aadil shakhs ko, ya do aadil shakhs ko gawah banaye, aur na chhupaye, aur na ghaib kare, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye to woh us ka zyada haqdar hai, warna woh Allah ka maal hai jise chahta hai deta hai."
